  "multichoice": {
    "content_hash": "b3cd6cda967da36d8eaa71aa8a381d41fb1ef17332e59ffc4320ec1aeca5e33f",
    "text": "00% CHANGE COUNTRY Angola Botswana Eswatini Ethiopia Ghana Kenya Mauritius Malawi Mozambique Namibia Nigeria Tanzania Uganda South Africa Zambia Zimbabwe About Us Our People Companies & Brands Enriching Lives Africa's Storytellers Investors Media Enriching Lives We’re committed to uplifting, supporting, and investing in the communities in which we operate Creating Opportunities Catapulting the Youth Connecting and Creating Value Our Campaigns Enterprise Development MultiChoice’s Innovation Fund creates opportunities for innovators in the tech, media and film industries, to bring to life ideas that will lead to breakthrough moments for their businesses  We provide funding as well as mentorship and skills development for start-ups and established SMMEs  Find out more about our existing beneficiaries and where to submit business proposals More about the MultiChoice Innovation Fund DStv Agencies and Accredited Installers Thousands of jobs are created through our DStv Accredited Installer network  Decoder manufacturing All our decoders are manufactured locally and through high level manufacturing and assembly chains, we’ve stimulated the decoder manufacturing industry and as well as other related businesses such as parts suppliers, carton printers and distribution and logistics providers  Africa Accelerator The MultiChoice accelerator provides entrepreneurship skills and exposure to a network of global investors, creating opportunities for businesses to scale up and expand across the continent and the world  The programme specifically targets start-ups and small businesses in the technology sectors of health tech, agri-tech, fintech, edu-tech, the circular economy, and creative industries",
    "links": [
      {
        "title": "More about the MultiChoice Innovation Fund",
        "url": "https://www.multichoice.com/innovation-fund.php"
      }
    ]
  }
